<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-30T02:04:16.364Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:04:16 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Russian Su-35 fighter jets and S-400 air defence systems have been delivered to Ethiopia as fighting intensifies in Tigray and the Amhara region, with airstrikes reported around Rama for a third consecutive day. A drone strike hit the Hayiq Jari 2 IDP camp in Amhara, killing 16 civilians and injuring 22, and another drone hit a shelter in South Wollo Zone, causing further casualties. Armed attackers killed at least 60 Orthodox Christians in Oromia, and Major General Yohannes, a senior Tigray commander, was captured near the Eritrean border. The UCDP recorded 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw78prj801pvo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQSl9RZXktMzNjWWNNLUtNT1AySlhCNTltZ1ktWENhQVFWaVd3aGdDMkRZVFgzZktHWHp3Z0RKcENRb3NueEs0UHZRcS1yTmVlZTRrNndOSEhTRHBEVGJnQmc5WS1zMnQ5Ymx0VVRGNVpnR25oWG5UaVR6MTA1WXVoZXlQNEQ0WWdOeHB6eGhBSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPT3hPbDhOUkczc2FzTVBiTVNfTEVaQXNUQnl0T0Nob1JIQ3BVcWtMUmo5UkhheW12MjltcEpzcE95MFZMRHhmTHRaeU10UWtFMWFhWk1yMU1HdVJ3Z2c2RkpYWi10MTI2U1FRQzJiaS1SSXA2andZb2lMY3hUZXlJMDg4cHp1eEUtV0pxWHBrbFZBSFFncGZWR1dkX2dXU0xYNFBuXy0tWlA0UVhFWmhTY0hR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Around Prague&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxONEpNUDA5NllrNGVrc3Jyb0d2Nl9iaGFoZWtzc1Izb2JqbXpRMWJjZTF6QUg4c0IxUzlwVXU0LXJWaTh2UmxzMDFCYkttMV8wS1FydGFYc1dnbzNmVzI5VUVMeV9scGJZcFlDbU9rWkUxTXZDektKYTFGVkdRbEhVYk0w